flowchart TD
    Input[Prescription text or local OCR] --> Identity[Ingredient resolution and retained candidates]
    Identity --> Source[Known source-record screening]
    Identity --> Join[Cached candidate joins for each entry pair]
    Join --> Candidates[Stable predicates and conditional source findings]
    Source --> Findings[Documented findings with original severity]
    FDA[Frozen sourced enzyme and transporter roles] --> Paths[Directed mechanism-path queries]
    Identity --> Paths
    Paths --> Hypotheses[Mechanism-supported possibilities without severity]
    PubChem[Versioned ingredient-to-molecule mapping] --> Fingerprints[Morgan molecular features]
    Training[Training-only message edges and frozen severity splits] --> GNN[GraphSAGE and molecular fusion]
    Fingerprints --> GNN
    FDA --> GNN
    GNN --> Calibration[Temperature scaling and conservative abstention]
    Calibration --> CPU[Versioned cached CPU checkpoint]
    Source --> Unknown[Documented pairs with unknown source severity]
    Unknown --> CPU
    CPU --> Predictions[Experimental source-severity estimates and abstentions]
    CPU --> XAI[Offline model rationale evaluations]
    Findings --> Dossier[Local application and versioned reports]
    Candidates --> Dossier
    Hypotheses --> Dossier
    Predictions --> Dossier
    XAI --> Dossier
    Findings --> Evidence[Evidence graph support relationships]
    Hypotheses --> Separate[Separate hypothesis and prediction graph relationships]
    Predictions --> Separate
    Evidence --> Dossier
    Separate --> Dossier
    Dossier --> Replay[Replay with matching code, data, feature, model and calibration hashes]
